  "contentHtml": "<p>작년에 전교생 대상으로 처음 실시해봤는데..</p><p>전교생 대상으로 공정하게 실시하려니</p><p>수업시간 중에 사진찍어 플랫폼에 업로드하고 확인하고</p><p>보고서 작성하고 심사하고...&#160;</p><p>본선은 학년별로 ppt 발표와 질문답변으로 심사하고...</p><p>좀 힘들었지만 해볼만했습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/00f96ef26fdc918faa1212f3740dbb9f499380bf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/00f96ef26fdc918faa1212f3740dbb9f499380bf\" data-origin-width=\"794\" data-origin-height=\"1123\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f30790894041bf0462c20705902fcc2d429f45ee\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f30790894041bf0462c20705902fcc2d429f45ee\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
